7c4b0046-64b6-48aa-827c-fa188e4262e5/6015-1
00:40:38.697 --> 00:40:40.323
<v Takeshi Teshima (TUS)>まあ最も進んでいる。</v>

7c4b0046-64b6-48aa-827c-fa188e4262e5/6047-0
